From: ajensenwaud <ajensenwaud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 18:22:24 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 42/45] inkling2: the experts' grouping in one pass over the
 pairs, item list included

tf_exl3_group compares every expert against every pick (3.9 ms a layer at 2,048 rows); the family's
group counts a warp's share of the pairs, places them in pair order and writes the item list in the
same launch. Same lists, same member order, so the layer output keeps its bits. Harness, 2,048 rows:
3,862 -> 36 us a layer; 8 rows 18.9 -> 6.5 us.
---
 zig/kernels/cuda/inkling2/experts.cu  | 149 +++++++++++++++++---------
 zig/src/families/inkling2/experts.zig |  25 ++---
 2 files changed, 107 insertions(+), 67 deletions(-)

